sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant Web as Next.js
  participant API as Main API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant LLM as LLM Provider
  U->>Web: Generate email
  Web->>API: POST /emails/generate SSE
  API->>DB: load context
  API->>DB: check entitlements
  API->>LLM: stream completion
  loop tokens
    LLM-->>API: token
    API-->>Web: SSE token
  end
  API->>DB: save EmailAsset
  API-->>Web: SSE done
